on the first day here, right?

5
00:00:15,974 --> 00:00:18,601
- And were you excited to get it?
- I was.

6
00:00:18,685 --> 00:00:19,936
- [Assun] Yes, right?
- Mm-hmm.

7
00:00:20,020 --> 00:00:21,396
