ENTREPRENEUR/HOSTESS

8
00:00:21,479 --> 00:00:23,898
You can imagine how much it'd hurt
to write someone a letter

9
00:00:23,982 --> 00:00:25,191
and never get a reply.

10
00:00:25,275 --> 00:00:26,151
Mm.

11
00:00:28,111 --> 00:00:30,947
[Ruru] At the very least,
you could have pulled Maririn aside

12
00:00:31,030 --> 00:00:32,741
- to explain how you feel.
- [Assun] Exactly.

13
00:00:32,824 --> 00:00:33,742
Mm.

14
00:00:35,160 --> 00:00:37,871
No girl's gonna fall for a guy
who acts like that.

15
00:00:37,954 --> 00:00:39,039
Mm.

16
00:00:39,122 --> 00:00:42,042
What you did is something
that a "real man" would never do.

17
00:00:42,125 --> 00:00:45,045
We've all been looking for a real man
in our relationships, not a boy.

18
00:00:45,128 --> 00:00:46,087
RURU (26)
MODEL

19
00:00:46,171 --> 00:00:48,381
We all came to this school
looking for that.

20
00:00:48,465 --> 00:00:49,299
[Tai-chan] Mm.

21
00:00:49,382 --> 00:00:52,260
So if this is the kind of guy you are,
none of us need you, okay?

22
00:00:56,473 --> 00:00:58,975
Date other people if you want,
but be straight up about it.

23
00:00:59,059 --> 00:00:59,893
[Tai-chan] Mm.

24
00:00:59,976 --> 00:01:02,687
And Maririn has serious trauma
from past relationships.

25
00:01:02,771 --> 00:01:03,938
MARIRIN (25)
BAR WORKER

26
00:01:04,022 --> 00:01:05,940
- Which you found out today, right?
- Mm.

27
00:01:06,024 --> 00:01:08,735
It's like you're not taking
Maririn's trauma seriously.

28
00:01:12,072 --> 00:01:13,865
Yeah, I mean, I get it.

29
00:01:14,365 --> 00:01:16,242
Um, it's true. You're right.

30
00:01:16,743 --> 00:01:19,454
- I really messed up everything with you.
- [Maririn] Yeah.

31
00:01:19,537 --> 00:01:20,830
And, you know, I'm just…

32
00:01:21,539 --> 00:01:22,373
sorry.

33
00:01:22,874 --> 00:01:25,251
- Anyone can say that. [laughs]
- Yep. Mm-hmm.

34
00:01:25,335 --> 00:01:28,213
- [Ruru] This isn't to make you apologize.
- [Maririn] No, it's not.

35
00:01:28,296 --> 00:01:30,048
- That's not why we're here.
- [Ruru] Right.

36
00:01:30,131 --> 00:01:32,842
- What do they want from him? [sighs]
- [Megumi] I know.

37
00:01:32,926 --> 00:01:35,136
I think it was good
that he apologized first, though.

38
00:01:35,220 --> 00:01:36,471
[Nagano] You're right.

39
00:01:36,554 --> 00:01:39,057
If you're not into her like that,
you should tell her.

40
00:01:39,140 --> 00:01:41,100
- Mm.
- [Assun] But not talking to her?

41
00:01:41,810 --> 00:01:42,769
And just, like…

42
00:01:43,520 --> 00:01:44,813
leaving her hanging?

43
00:01:45,730 --> 00:01:47,482
- And that's just not right.
- Mm.

44
00:01:47,565 --> 00:01:49,609
I honestly think you're a piece trash.

45
00:01:49,692 --> 00:01:52,320
- [Megumi] <i>Wow.</i>
- [Nagano] <i>Did she need to go that far?</i>

46
00:01:52,946 --> 00:01:55,365
If you don't change,
if you can't act like a man,

47
00:01:55,448 --> 00:01:57,325
- then no one is gonna love you.
- [Tai-chan] Mm.

48
00:02:00,787 --> 00:02:04,374
It made me feel like
opening up to you was all for nothing.

49
00:02:05,208 --> 00:02:08,086
It look a lot for me
to pour my heart out like that,

50
00:02:08,670 --> 00:02:11,714
