you've just forgotten all of it.

51
00:02:13,383 --> 00:02:14,342
You're shallow.

52
00:02:17,387 --> 00:02:20,306
I realize now that
I didn't treat you right at all.

53
00:02:21,349 --> 00:02:22,976
It was really pathetic of me.

54
00:02:23,518 --> 00:02:24,936
- You mean it?
- [Tai-chan] Mm.

55
00:02:29,858 --> 00:02:30,900
- [sniffles]
- [Awich] <i>What?</i>

56
00:02:30,984 --> 00:02:33,153
- [Megumi] <i>Aw, Tai-chan…</i>
- [Nagano] <i>Oh, come on, now.</i>

57
00:02:33,236 --> 00:02:34,487
- [Awich] <i>What?</i>
- [Megumi] <i>Aw.</i>

58
00:02:34,988 --> 00:02:36,156
[Tai-chan sniffles]

59
00:02:36,239 --> 00:02:38,741
[Megumi] <i>Aw, Tai-chan's crying.</i>

60
00:02:38,825 --> 00:02:40,034
