61
00:02:40,118 --> 00:02:41,536
I'll be straight up.

62
00:02:42,620 --> 00:02:45,623
Everything's so messed up
right now. Mm-hmm.

63
00:02:47,375 --> 00:02:49,752
She really poured her heart out
in that letter.

64
00:02:51,254 --> 00:02:54,090
Mm… I just really messed it up.

65
00:02:55,925 --> 00:02:56,843
Stupid.

66
00:02:58,136 --> 00:02:59,095
It's pathetic.

67
00:03:00,597 --> 00:03:02,307
So, tell me, what do you think about this?

68
00:03:02,390 --> 00:03:03,850
I feel bad for him.

69
00:03:03,933 --> 00:03:06,853
- [laughing] This time!
- Yeah, this time.

70
00:03:06,936 --> 00:03:07,896
NAGANO

71
00:03:07,979 --> 00:03:09,230
A STRONG RIVAL CAN BE A FRIEND

72
