- [Ari] Here he is.
- [Ma-kun] Dude, he's here.

73
00:03:11,190 --> 00:03:13,234
- [Ari] What's up?
- [Ma-kun] What's up?

74
00:03:13,318 --> 00:03:14,986
- What's going on? What's wrong?
- What?

75
00:03:15,069 --> 00:03:16,029
MA-KUN (28)
MMA FIGHTER

76
00:03:16,112 --> 00:03:19,032
