81
00:03:28,082 --> 00:03:30,043
Assun, and Ruru

82
00:03:31,002 --> 00:03:31,836
and Maririn.

83
00:03:31,920 --> 00:03:33,713
So, wait, all three?

84
00:03:33,796 --> 00:03:34,672
