85
00:03:35,214 --> 00:03:38,801
So, yesterday,
she rewrote her letter to me.

86
00:03:39,969 --> 00:03:41,763
- Maririn did, I mean.
- [Ma-kun] Okay.

87
00:03:41,846 --> 00:03:43,389
LEO (25)
BAR OWNER

88
00:03:43,473 --> 00:03:44,474
And after that,

89
00:03:45,350 --> 00:03:48,269
I left things hanging all day
without saying anything.

90
00:03:49,520 --> 00:03:50,772
I focused on Hikaru.

91
00:03:51,439 --> 00:03:52,690
ARI (29)
RAPPER/MODEL

92
00:03:52,774 --> 00:03:54,984
