- [Leo] Oh! Wow.

93
00:03:55,777 --> 00:03:57,445
You probably should have talked to her.

94
00:03:58,446 --> 00:03:59,280
Yeah.

95
00:04:00,990 --> 00:04:02,992
You all know,
I've been saying from the start,

96
00:04:03,076 --> 00:04:05,036
