what I would do if that happened.

102
00:04:18,424 --> 00:04:19,467
Mm.

103
00:04:20,843 --> 00:04:24,555
The girls are definitely
seeing things differently than we do.

104
00:04:24,639 --> 00:04:26,391
- [Bou] Mm.
- They're not playing around.

105
00:04:26,474 --> 00:04:28,518
- [Bou] Yeah, they're going deep.
- Uh-huh.

106
00:04:28,601 --> 00:04:30,061
