156
00:07:20,940 --> 00:07:23,734
I just wasn't honest
about how I felt, at all.

157
00:07:23,818 --> 00:07:25,695
Of course, I told the guys what happened.

158
00:07:26,696 --> 00:07:30,158
And I think,
that the girls all talked about it too.

159
00:07:31,159 --> 00:07:35,580
But I wanted to be straight with everyone
today, and tell you all that I'm sorry.

160
00:07:38,833 --> 00:07:41,794
Um… And believe me, I know that…

161
00:07:42,336 --> 00:07:45,339
that actions,
they speak louder than words, so,

162
00:07:46,090 --> 00:07:48,134
I'm gonna do better from here on out.

163
00:07:48,843 --> 00:07:49,760
Don't give up on me.

164
00:07:49,844 --> 00:07:51,554
