- [Ruru] What?

198
00:09:08,839 --> 00:09:10,007
- [Leo] Ready?
- [Ari] Let's go!

199
00:09:12,969 --> 00:09:14,554
Ready? Fight!

200
00:09:16,597 --> 00:09:19,058
