- Do you want a time-out?

208
00:09:30,152 --> 00:09:31,821
- Call timeout?
- There's timeout?

209
00:09:31,904 --> 00:09:33,322
- No timeouts, right?
- No timeouts.

210
00:09:33,406 --> 00:09:36,033
