- [Leo] Ready?

226
00:10:07,273 --> 00:10:08,649
[Ruru] Assun is strong.

227
00:10:08,733 --> 00:10:10,151
Ready? Fight!

228
00:10:10,234 --> 00:10:11,944
[Ari] Let's go, Hikaru. Crush it!

229
00:10:12,945 --> 00:10:14,113
